~
   A monk glowing with a gold aura hovers before you in a meditative state.  A
wave of serenity passes through you as you enter the chamber.  Draken is a
weathered and reputable solemn monk of the highest order, perhaps even as high
as Buddha himself.  As you notice he is actually floating in mid-air, you
realise that even with the chaos and carnage surrounding him, one must find
nirvana within themselves to achieve this level of neutrality, empathy, and
tranquility.  It's quite possible Washnil and Elru fear this monk and do not
dare to cross his path.  You would be wise to follow suit.    
~
