eagle's feathers, browns and whites blending into the shining golden fur of the
body.  The wings are powerful, and could certainly propel Citera, The Golden
Chimera into the air.  Her tail is that of a lion, but larger and stronger then
any on a mere lioness.  It is capable of tremendous feats of power and
dexterity, able to grab small objects or smash large ones to pieces.  The giant
paws are large enough to crush a man whole, and each claw is long enough to
dwarf a dwarf.
