with hunting instincts, most of the brains of the chimera come from the lioness
in her.  Golden furred, she will defend her pride as needed, and provide for
them in times of need.  Her sharp eyes gleam with her intelligence, and her
long fangs sparkle in the light.  Sniffing the air for the scent of intruders,
she growls occasionally as something interesting comes to her on the wind.  
